{"title": "\u77f3\u7aa6\u6536\u4e91 | \u6587\u5b66\u521b\u4f5c\n", "title_in": "\u77f3\u7aa6\u6536\u4e91 | \u6587\u5b66\u521b\u4f5c\n", "body": "<h1>\n \u6587\u5b66\u521b\u4f5c\n</h1>\n<div class=\"row\">\n <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n  <div class=\"accordion\" id=\"accordionExample\">\n   <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <h2 class=\"accordion-header\">\n     <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse1\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" id=\"h1\" type=\"button\">\n      \u8bd7\n     </button>\n    </h2>\n    <div class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionExample\" id=\"collapse1\">\n     <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n      <ul class=\"list-group\">\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=1&amp;type=1\" id=\"p1\">\n        \u9633\u5149\u4fa7\u5e73 \uff08\u5b59\u4f73\u94ed\uff0c\u7b14\u540d\uff1a\u62c2\u67f3\uff09\n       </a>\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=2&amp;type=1\" id=\"p2\">\n        \u62a4\u62e6 \uff08\u674e\u519b\u660a\uff09\n       </a>\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=3&amp;type=1\" id=\"p3\">\n        \u8001\u5e08\u4e0e\u5b66\u751f \uff08\u674e\u519b\u660a\uff09\n       </a>\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=4&amp;type=1\" id=\"p4\">\n        \u623f\u6b63 \uff08\u674e\u519b\u660a\uff09\n       </a>\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=5&amp;type=1\" id=\"p5\">\n        \u7f8e\u9a74\u4e0e\u91ce\u517d \uff08\u674e\u519b\u660a\uff09\n       </a>\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=6&amp;type=1\" id=\"p6\">\n        \u71ac\u591c \uff08\u674e\u519b\u660a\uff09\n       </a>\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=7&amp;type=1\" id=\"p7\">\n        \u8c22\u6731\u946b\u78ca \uff08\u674e\u519b\u660a\uff09\n       </a>\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=8&amp;type=1\" id=\"p8\">\n        \u4e00\u6708\u5341\u65e5\u6c60\u5858\u7ed3\u51b0 \uff08\u674e\u519b\u660a\uff09\n       </a>\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=9&amp;type=1\" id=\"p9\">\n        \u4f5c\u4e1a\u8bba \uff08\u674e\u519b\u660a\uff09\n       </a>\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=10&amp;type=1\" id=\"p10\">\n        \u9001\u6731\u946b\u78ca \uff08\u674e\u519b\u660a\uff09\n       </a>\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=11&amp;type=1\" id=\"p11\">\n        \u5357\u5b8b\u5317\u8bd7\u521d\u4e2d\u751f \uff08\u674e\u519b\u660a\uff09\n       </a>\n      </ul>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <h2 class=\"accordion-header\">\n     <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse2\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" id=\"h2\" type=\"button\">\n      \u8bcd\n     </button>\n    </h2>\n    <div class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionExample\" id=\"collapse2\">\n     <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n      <ul class=\"list-group\">\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=12&amp;type=2\" id=\"p12\">\n        \u6e14\u5bb6\u50b2\u00b7\u5f00\u5b66 \uff08\u674e\u519b\u660a\uff09\n       </a>\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=13&amp;type=2\" id=\"p13\">\n        \u5982\u68a6\u4ee4\u00b7\u6691\u65e5\u8bfe\u4e1a \uff08\u970d\u6c9b\u9716\uff0c\u7b14\u540d\uff1a\u666e\u9716\uff09\n       </a>\n      </ul>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <h2 class=\"accordion-header\">\n     <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse3\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" id=\"h3\" type=\"button\">\n      \u66f2\n     </button>\n    </h2>\n    <div class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionExample\" id=\"collapse3\">\n     <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n      <ul class=\"list-group\">\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=14&amp;type=3\" id=\"p14\">\n        \u5929\u51c0\u6c99\u00b7\u4e00\u521d\u4e2d\uff08\u5176\u4e00\uff09 \uff08\u674e\u519b\u660a\uff09\n       </a>\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=15&amp;type=3\" id=\"p15\">\n        \u5929\u51c0\u6c99\u00b7\u4e00\u521d\u4e2d\uff08\u5176\u4e8c\uff09 \uff08\u674e\u519b\u660a\uff09\n       </a>\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=16&amp;type=3\" id=\"p16\">\n        \u5929\u51c0\u6c99\u00b7\u52a8\u70b9 \uff08\u674e\u519b\u660a\uff09\n       </a>\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=17&amp;type=3\" id=\"p17\">\n        \u5929\u51c0\u6c99\u00b7\u6691\u5047\u8fc7\u534a \uff08\u674e\u519b\u660a\uff09\n       </a>\n       <a class=\"list-group-item\" href=\"#p=18&amp;type=3\" id=\"p18\">\n        \u5b8b\u541b\u66f2 \uff08\u4faf\u5929\u4f51\uff09\n       </a>\n      </ul>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"col-md-6\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\">\n  <div id=\"content\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n  </div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n !(function() {\n                        \n    (window.onhashchange = function () {\n\n        var p = getarg('p') || 1;\n        var type = getarg('type') || 1;\n        var url = getarg('url') || \"\";\n        if (url && url != \"/text/index.html\") {\n            load();\n            return;\n        }\n        for (var i = 1; $(\"#p\" + i).length > 0; i++) {\n            if ($(\"#p\" + i).attr(\"href\").indexOf(\"url=\") == -1)\n                $(\"#p\" + i).attr(\"href\", $(\"#p\" + i).attr(\"href\") + \"&url=\" + url);\n        }\n        $('#content').html('<div class=\"spinner-border\"></div>');\n        $.get(true_root + \"/text/articles/\" + p + \".html\").then(\n            function (data) {\n                $('#content').html(data);\n            }\n        ).fail(\n            function () {\n                $('#content').html('<div class=\"alert alert-danger\">\u52a0\u8f7d\u5931\u8d25</div>');\n            }\n        )\n        for (var i = 1; i <= 100; i++) {\n            $('#p' + i).removeClass('active');\n        }\n        $('#p' + p).addClass('active');\n\n        $('#h' + type).removeClass('collapsed');\n        $('#collapse' + type).addClass('show');\n    })();\n\n                    })();\n</script>\n", "rootdef": ".."}